# Compose

- Services allowed: postgres, minio, redis, mailpit, api, web.
- No cloud images that require a vendor account at runtime.
- Seed official fixtures on boot (after kickoff files exist).
- Network-off laptop must still start the portal.
- Load `.skills/docker-offline/SKILL.md` before adding a service or dependency.
